-------|-----|\n| 1 | `pow43` | Direct table path: `-16 <= x < 129` | [ ] |\n| 2 | `pow43` | Scaled path: `129 <= x < 1024`, `(x << 3) & 32 == 0` (`sign == 0`) | [ ] |\n| 3 | `pow43` | Scaled path: `129 <= x < 1024`, `(x << 3) & 32 != 0` (`sign == 64`) | [ ] |\n| 4 | `pow43` | Unscaled path: `1024 <= x <= 8223`, `x & 32 == 0` (`sign == 0`) | [ ] |\n| 5 | `pow43` | Unscaled path: `1024 <= x <= 8223`, `x & 32 != 0` (`sign == 64`) | [ ] |\n\nThe valid boundaries come mechanically from the 145-element table and its\nindex expressions: `16 + x` on the direct path and\n`16 + ((x + sign) >> 6)` on interpolation paths.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
